5,1,1,talk,George,,I worry we are just moving the sore point. Let us look at what actually sours groups like ours before deciding anything.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"Agreed. The friction is in the coordination, not the driving. I want to see where those hours actually go before we commit.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I need to know the car’s condition at handover. If it’s unreliable, no schedule fixes the daily frustration I face.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I’m concerned about the hidden costs. We need to see the tax and insurance papers to understand the true baseline before splitting anything.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I just want to know the real numbers. Who drives how much? I don’t want to guess anymore.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
