35,2,1,talk,George,,"@Toshio, the other households said asking favours sours things. We must avoid that trap.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"@George, the trial data confirms the coordination cost is high. Nearly an hour weekly just to track it. We need a system that minimizes that overhead.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, that overhead is real, but the mechanic’s warning about cold runs is critical. We must address the vehicle’s physical state before optimizing schedules.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Toshio, the fuel data is stark. Two people bought over half the litres. We need to see if the fixed costs match that usage.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minato,,"@Misaki, the diary shows Saturdays are much busier than Tuesdays. I think the costs should match that difference.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,George,,"@Misaki, the checking spell made us feel accused. We must avoid that dynamic. How do we verify costs without creating resentment?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@George, resentment comes from ambiguity. If the rules are clear and the data is automatic, there is nothing to accuse. We just need to remove the manual labor.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, automatic data won’t fix a car left with low fuel. I need a standard for handover, not just tracking.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Victoria, the fixed costs are 280,000 yen. That’s a baseline. We can’t ignore it when splitting the variable fuel costs.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Misaki, twenty-eight thousand yen? That is a lot. I am a little scared. How do we share that fairly?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,George,,"@Minato, do not panic. The fear comes from the unknown. Let us look at the options before we decide how to share it.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Minato, fear is natural. But the data shows the problem is tracking, not the car. We need a system that removes the manual burden.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Minato, fear is understandable, but the car’s physical neglect is the immediate threat. We need a handover standard to ensure it is actually drivable for me.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Minato, it is 280,000 yen, not twenty-eight thousand. That is the fixed baseline. We must account for it before splitting the fuel costs.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@Misaki, I am sorry. I misread the numbers. That is a very large amount. I feel a bit dizzy.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,George,,"@Minato, breathe. The number is fixed, but the solution is flexible. We will find a way that does not burden you.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Minato, the fixed cost is unavoidable. The variable cost is where we can be fair. Let us focus on the system, not the panic.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Minato, the fixed cost is a fact, but the car’s condition is a choice. We must ensure it is safe and ready before we split bills.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Minato, it is manageable if we split it evenly. The fuel imbalance is the real issue. Let us wait for the options.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minato,,"@George, thank you. I am trying to breathe. I just want the numbers to be clear so I do not feel lost.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
